<title>UK: Westfaelische Hypo sets 200 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Westfaelische Hypo sets 200 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTFAELISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON  ** 4.50	MATURITY    02.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.20    PAY DATE   S03.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> NOTES   ** 4.5 TO 02.APR.97, 5.0 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    DUES	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 3911</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
